00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:08.208 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Tout juste arrivées

00:00:05.906 --> 00:00:09.443 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Franceseses infirmières

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:10.677 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont en formation. Elles ont

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.878 size:53% position:73% line:53%
